# PLACEHOLDER -- Warped Kush: Purple Kush's own art (Warlon Mhite's), recoloured by a hue map, not
# redrawn. Leaf greens and the grey-violet foliage -> warped teal, the purple calyx -> Blueberry
# blue, red accents -> violet; the orange pistils stay, as Blueberry's do and shroomlight is. The
# seed goes teal so a hotbar tells it from the others; the spliff keeps its paper and takes a teal
# ember. Re-derive from the Purple Kush files if those are ever redrawn. The crop is UNTINTED: its
# models parent hempdustry:block/crop_cross, so these colours are exactly what a player sees.

